  "author_preprocessing": "Source workbooks, weather files, figures and processing code. Specific energy/avoided emissions and source plots are derived; supplied code is preserved, not run. The archive weather fields have an unresolved upstream provider and may be modeled/reanalysis products; they are not counted as measured-only evidence.",
  "known_analyses_and_limitations": "Hold out whole plants or time blocks. Verify weather-provider attribution and join timestamps before modeling. Derived emissions cannot be independent evidence for energy laws. Primary eligibility rests on the measured PV production and plant metadata; use weather only with its unresolved origin explicitly bounded.",
